 to the Inter-\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 25, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [572, 905, 1013, 929], \"page_id\": 17}], \"content\": \"national Moetary Fund pursuant to Public Law 86-48, approved June 17, 1959.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 26, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [578, 929, 730, 945], \"page_id\": 17}], \"content\": \"Less than $500,000.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 27, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [24, 14, 31, 27], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [893, 6, 1068, 40], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"Treasury Bulletin\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [401, 60, 702, 74], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"BUDGET RECEIPTS AND EXPENDITURES\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [377, 108, 724, 126], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"Table 2.- Expenditures by Agencies\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [471, 132, 628, 145], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"(In millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [24, 151, 1074, 578], \"page_id\": 18}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Fiscal year or month</th><th>Total</th><th>Legislative branch</th><th>Judiciary</th><th>Executive Office of the President</th><th>Funds appropriated to the President</th><th>Independent offices</th><th>General Services Administration</th><th>Housing and Home Finance Agency</th><th>Agriculture Department</th><th>Commerce Department</th></tr><tr><td>1953</td><td>74,274</td><td>61</td><td>27</td><td>9</td><td>5,782</td><td>6,905</td><td>1,107</td><td>385</td><td>3,217</td><td>1,063</td></tr><tr><td>1954</td><td>67,772</td><td>59</td><td>28</td><td>9</td><td>5,282</td><td>6,479 1/2</td><td>806</td><td>-615</td><td>2,915</td><td>1,00