 F and G savings bonds for Treasury 3-1/4% bonds of 1978-83, less than $500,000.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [9, 21, 160, 52], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"February 1960\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1025, 27, 1051, 48], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"51\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [401, 71, 660, 90], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"UNITED STATES SAVINGS BONDS\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [146, 115, 912, 139], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"Table 5.- Sales and Redemptions by Denominations, Series E and H 1/2 Combined\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"section_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [442, 145, 611, 161], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"(In thousands of pieces)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [4, 161, 1053, 713], \"page_id\": 65}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Period</th><th>Total all denominations</th><th>$10 2/</th><th>$25</th><th>$50</th><th>$100</th><th>$200 3/</th><th>$500</th><th>$1,000</th><th>$5,000</th><th>$10,000 4/ 5/</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\\\"11\\\">Sales</td></tr><tr><td>Fiscal years:</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>1951-52</td><td>1,445,363</td><td>21,076</td><td>988,828</td><td>221,336</td><td>163,453</td><td>6,265</td><td>21,999</td><td>22,403</td><td>1</td><td>7</td></tr><tr><td>1952-53</td><td>80,485</td><td>-</td><td>54,380</td><td>14,372</td><td>8,211</td><td>794</td><td>1,243</td><td>1,462</td><td>16</td><td>14</td></tr><tr><td>1954 6/</td><td>85,419</td><td>-</td><td>56,903</td><td>15,686</td><td>8,810</td><td>854</td><td>1,411</td><td>1,708</td><td>33</td><td>26</td></tr><tr><td>1955 5/</td><td>85,342</td><td>-</td><td>55,164</td><td>16,374</td