.\\nP\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"footnote\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [5, 10, 158, 40], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"February 1960\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 0, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [1025, 19, 1047, 39], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"55\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 1, \"type\": \"page_number\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [308, 58, 750, 81], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"TREASURY SURVEY OF OWNERSHIP, NOVEMBER 30, 1959\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 2, \"type\": \"page_header\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [4, 102, 515, 266], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"The Treasury Survey of Ownership covers securities issued by the United States Government and by Federal agencies. The banks and insurance companies included in the Survey account for approximately 95 percent of such securities held by all banks and insurance companies in the United States. Data were first published for March 31, 1941, in the May 1941 \\\"Treasury Bulletin\\\".\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [547, 105, 1051, 266], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"Distribution of ownership by types of banks and insurance companies is published each month. Holdings by commercial banks distributed according to Federal Reserve member bank classes and nonmember banks are published for June 30 and December 31. Holdings by corporate pension trust funds are published quarterly and first appeared in the March 1954 Bulletin for quarters beginning December 31, 1949.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [138, 290, 896, 321], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"Section I - Securities Issued or Guaranteed by the United States Government\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [346, 318, 714, 342], \"page_id\": 69}], \"content\": \"Table 1.- Summary of All Securities\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"se